            "review_title": "Review at Cơm Quê Minh Thành",
            "review_text": "Quidam\n165 contributions\n0\nPleasant\nMar 2025 • Couples\nSmall restaurant found a chance from an alley while visiting Mong Phụ (Đường Lâm). A lady warmly welcomes us and settles us in an empty outdoor room that seems to have been the course of a pagoda. We were able to taste many different dishes and quite well cooked, while being quiet. A pleasant experience.\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten April 16, 2025",
